# step9.rules - primary/09_configure_fsfo.sh
Enter username for observer \[[^]]*\]:	@OBSERVER_USER@
Auto-prefix the username as C##[^\n]*\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
Enter password for new user [^:\n]*:	@OBSERVER_PASSWORD@	secret
Do you want to reset the password for [^\n]*\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
Enter new password for [^:\n]*:	@OBSERVER_PASSWORD@	secret
Confirm password:	@OBSERVER_PASSWORD@	secret
# Observer placement (asked only on a TTY, only when no observer is connected)
Is an observer already set up on another host\? \(y/n\) \[n\]:	@OBS_ALREADY@
Select option \[1\]:	@OBS_PLACEMENT@
# add_observer/01_prepare_primary.sh, when placement 2 was chosen
Hostname of the third host that will run the observer \[[^]]*\]:	@HOST3_NAME@
Reset the password for [^\n]* now\? \[y/N\]:	n
Enable Fast-Start Failover anyway\? \[y/N\]:	y
